{"id":"n14440-1-5","stage":2,"title":"번개 · 闪电","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14440-1-5-1","ko":"방금 하늘이 번쩍했지?","zh":"刚才天空闪了一下吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"방금","meaning":"刚才，方才","explanation":"방금：刚才，方才","readings":[{"term":"방금","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92065","senseId":"1","lemma":"방금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하늘이","meaning":"天空","explanation":"하늘：天空；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"하늘","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20311","senseId":"1","lemma":"하늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"번쩍했지?","meaning":"一闪","explanation":"번쩍하다：一闪；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"번쩍하다","audio":"/audio/828ed5da3317196b2f58.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59110","senseId":"5","lemma":"번쩍하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2fd9e7d411752b46","term":"방금","zh":"刚才，方才","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3","entryId":"92065","definition":"比说话时刻稍微早一点的时间。","pronunciation":["방금"]},{"id":"4cd0df8d103d3a7b","term":"하늘","zh":"天空","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3","entryId":"20311","definition":"地面上无限伸展的空间。","pronunciation":["하늘"]},{"id":"828ed5da3317196b","term":"번쩍하다","zh":"一闪","audio":"/audio/828ed5da3317196b2f58.mp3","entryId":"59110","definition":"某对象瞬间分明地看得见。","pronunciation":["번쩌카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3671fe84b432abdf0823.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14440-1-5-2","ko":"번개가 쳤나 봐. 천둥소리도 들렸잖아.","zh":"大概是闪电，还听到了雷声呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"번개가","meaning":"闪电","explanation":"번개：闪电；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"번개","audio":"/audio/cb427961331d503d4917.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14440","senseId":"1","lemma":"번개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쳤나","meaning":"打","explanation":"치다：打；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28127","senseId":"2","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"천둥소리도","meaning":"雷声","explanation":"천둥소리：雷声；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"천둥소리","audio":"/audio/afdaee00ba64c513d45f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77543","senseId":"1","lemma":"천둥소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들렸잖아.","meaning":"听到，传来","explanation":"들리다：听到，传来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"들리다","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70783","senseId":"1","lemma":"들리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"cb427961331d503d","term":"번개","zh":"闪电","audio":"/audio/cb427961331d503d4917.mp3","entryId":"14440","definition":"下雨时和打雷声一起在天空瞬间闪现的强光。","pronunciation":["번개"]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"打","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"28127","definition":"雷或闪电等出现时发出巨响或光芒。","pronunciation":["치다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"afdaee00ba64c513","term":"천둥소리","zh":"雷声","audio":"/audio/afdaee00ba64c513d45f.mp3","entryId":"77543","definition":"闪电过后，空中响起的巨大响声。","pronunciation":["천둥소리"]},{"id":"f5d8f68f409d3cd7","term":"들리다","zh":"听到，传来","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3","entryId":"70783","definition":"通过耳朵接受声音。","pronunciation":["들리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5b8fa81c0adeb4ed6203.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.3,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14440","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sou